          <div class="highlights-strip__card"><img src="/images/highlights/ec-suzhou-garden.jpg" alt="苏州古典园林" loading="lazy" /><p class="highlights-strip__caption">每一块石、每一方水，都有人用心放置</p></div>
          <div class="highlights-strip__card"><img src="/images/highlights/ec-forbidden-city.jpg" alt="北京故宫" loading="lazy" /><p class="highlights-strip__caption">城墙之内的城，为帝王和时间而建</p></div>
          <div class="highlights-strip__card"><img src="/images/highlights/ec-pingjiang-canal.jpg" alt="苏州平江路夜晚运河" loading="lazy" /><p class="highlights-strip__caption">时间在这条水街里慢了下来</p></div>
